{"id":545,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"人間の尊厳を軸に探究と国際理解を深める","feature_description":"聖園女学院は「人間の尊厳のために」を教育のモットーに掲げ、信念・精励・温順を校訓としています。中学と高校を通じて、総合学習・総合探究で課題を調べ、整理し、発表する力を育てます。英語・国際教育やキャリア教育にも取り組み、知識を身に付けるだけでなく、自分の生き方や社会との関わりを考える学びを進めています。課題発見から成果発信までを経験する方針です。","clubs":[{"id":10496,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10497,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10498,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10499,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13669,"name":"軽音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13670,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13671,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13672,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13673,"name":"手芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13674,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13675,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13676,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13677,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.misono.jp/school/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13678,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url